<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Gissa started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gissa started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN-AMBRO said on Monday that it had started coverage of Mexican company Gissa with a Buy recomendation.</p>
<p>- &quot;Gissa is a major player in each of its divisions: autoparts, building materials and houseware. It is set to benefit from the Mexican recovery and aggressive campaigns to increase its already strong exports,&quot; analyst Alejandro Delgado said in a report.</p>
<p>- &quot;Despite its market leadership it trades at an 18.5 percent discount, offering an attractive play on the recovering Mexican economy,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
